| `secp256k1_ops.oo` | secp256k1 | Point/key constructors; length-only `is_valid: true` |
| `plonk_ops.oo` | Plonk | Host `Int` mod add/mul/pow/inv + gate structs |

Primitive exits for these three families live in **stubs**, not ops:

