| `falcon_stubs.oo` | 6 | NTT, FFT sampler, NTRU, LDL, sign |
| `secp256k1_stubs.oo` | 11 | Point add/mul, ECDSA, Schnorr, ECDH |
| `plonk_stubs.oo` | 3 | KZG pairing, FFT, plookup |

